    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. it just feels so intentional though, you know? like, how does a menu change happen to exactly hit my allergies at the same time they mess with my pay? it's like they're trying to gaslight me into thinking i'm crazy so they don't have to pay my severance. do you think it's possible they're actually coordinating these small things to make me quit?",
